# Timeline System

Spec: Timeline
Purpose:
  Provide temporal awareness to the .sdd system. The system must not only
  answer "what is true?" but also "what was true when?" and ""why did it change?"
  This is critical for historical code analysis, legacy system understanding,
  and audit trails on long-running projects.

Owns: timeline/

Navigation:
  Changes: @changes.sdd
  Snapshots: @snapshots.sdd
  Migrations: @migrations.sdd
  Evolution: @evolution.sdd

ReadOrder:
  1  @snapshots.sdd
  2  @changes.sdd
  3  @migrations.sdd
  4  @evolution.sdd

CrossReferences:
  Graph: @../graph/INDEX.sdd
  Knowledge: @../knowledge/INDEX.sdd
  EvolutionPolicy: @../policies/evolution.sdd

State: +
